#: ../../source/templates_replicate.md:85
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_replicate.md:86
msgid ""
"**Heavy display, light body**: rb-freigeist-neue at 700 weight creates "
"thundering headlines, while basier-square at 400 handles body text with "
"quiet efficiency. The contrast is extreme and intentional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_replicate.md:87
msgid ""
"**128px is a real size**: The closing manifesto \"Imagine what you can "
"build.\" uses 128px — bigger than most mobile screens. This is the design"
" equivalent of shouting from a rooftop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_replicate.md:88
msgid ""
"**Negative tracking on hero**: -1.8px letter-spacing at 72px creates "
"dense, impactful hero text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_replicate.md:89
msgid ""
"**Lowercase tags**: 12px basier-square uses `text-transform: lowercase` —"
" an unusual choice that creates a casual, developer-friendly vibe."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_replicate.md:90
msgid ""
"**Weight 600 as emphasis**: When basier-square needs emphasis, it uses "
"600 (semibold) — never bold (700), which is reserved for rb-freigeist-"
"neue display text."
msgstr ""

